config BR2_PACKAGE_PRIMITIVE_AUDIO
	bool "primitive-audio kernel module"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  ALSA PCM driver for the rv-emu-rs audio device at 0x10000200.
	  Exposes stereo S16_LE playback at 8000-192000 Hz; the driver
	  writes the application's rate into the device's sample-rate
	  register and paces the sample FIFO from an hrtimer.

	  Required by PrBoom (Doom) for sound output.
